s:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]axe_chop_overrun_indicator.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-jx[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-jx/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Overrun classifier in the Rust core[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core_classifier[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core_classifier: add the host-I/O-free `axe_overrun` module, its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]versioned wire records, and the `classify_chop_overrun` PyO3 binding [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that turns one chop's cached run history plus its lumberjack interval [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into a level/ratio verdict.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Record how long a chop actually blocked its tick[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]blocking_duration[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]blocking_duration: persist `script_duration_ms` on chop run entries so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]an agent-launching run keeps its script wall-clock after lifecycle [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]finalization overwrites `duration_ms`, and make the run-entry reader [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tolerate unknown keys.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Classify each chop while collecting AXE snapshots[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]snapshot_wiring[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core_classifier, blocking_duration[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]snapshot_wiring: add the typed Python facade, carry the effective [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]interval and the verdict on `ChopSnapshot`/`LumberjackSnapshot`, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compute both on the full collector and the targeted single-chop refresh [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]path.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Render the overrun mark across the AXE tab[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tab_indicator[dim] · [dim][/dim]after snapshot_wiring[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tab_indicator: paint the sidebar chop chip and lumberjack roll-up, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]overview table's PACE column and advisory line, the chop detail header [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]segment, the help guide legend, docs, and the PNG snapshots that pin all[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of it.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-jx","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-jx.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-8bdfc4f06075f880fae030c5eafb542c","started_at":"2026-08-12T14:00:24.144813+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"5ee328f1cb8a2c4eb167b338fc6d0ccc159f1eade047f8fefa2d6d004de41b82","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-jx.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-jx.land/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"87896a66d4afb6a5b8d6dab6155e960d2fbf44bb213457e08b2e92b9688bb788","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-jx.land/meta.json","size_bytes":613},"prompt":{"digest":"23694f80a831c3e236964365eb9678cd3826a337f2e1543ae33a33b8461ad0cf","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-jx.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":226},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"e5eb1e45696d996525e0ddf0f6828597bfe12155023ed1d16ab590fb5aa04547","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-jx.land/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":4173},"state":{"digest":"ff13ed6b28